@startuml
left to right direction
actor "Public visitor" as Public
actor "HEI preparer" as Prep
actor "HEI submitter" as Submit
actor "CHED records" as Records
actor "CHED reviewer" as Review
actor "CHED signatory" as Sign
actor "CHED monitor" as Monitor
actor "CHED case officer" as Cases
actor "CHED analyst" as Analyst
actor "System administrator" as Admin
rectangle LAKBAY {
 usecase "Read guidance" as Guidance
 usecase "Prepare forms / upload evidence" as Prepare
 usecase "File / correct / report" as File
 usecase "Locate regional records" as Locate
 usecase "Review completeness" as Complete
 usecase "Record signed acknowledgment" as Ack
 usecase "Monitor / assist / follow up" as Follow
 usecase "Record restricted external procedure" as Case
 usecase "Regional snapshots / exports" as Export
 usecase "Invitations / references / policy controls" as Manage
}
Public --> Guidance
Prep --> Prepare
Submit --> Prepare
Submit --> File
Records --> Locate
Review --> Complete
Sign --> Ack
Monitor --> Follow
Cases --> Case
Analyst --> Export
Admin --> Manage
note bottom of LAKBAY
Protected use cases require MFA and record-level authorization.
No national OSDS panel or automated external CEB decision.
end note
@enduml
